# EmailJS — get these from https://dashboard.emailjs.com
# 1. Create a Service (Gmail, SMTP, etc.) → copy Service ID
# 2. Create an Email Template → copy Template ID
# 3. Account → API Keys → copy Public Key
#
# Template variables to include in your EmailJS template:
#   {{to_name}}      — customer's full name
#   {{to_email}}     — customer's email (set as "To Email" in template)
#   {{wo_number}}    — e.g. WO-2025-123456
#   {{product}}      — product name
#   {{category}}     — general subject
#   {{issue}}        — specific issue
#   {{priority}}     — Low / Medium / High / Critical
#   {{description}}  — issue description
#   {{subject}}      — full email subject line (set as "Subject" in template)
#   {{submitted_at}} — timestamp
#   {{reply_to}}     — support@arkaserve.com

VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=service_xxxxxxx
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=template_xxxxxxx
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
